php-perfcached (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * keys() takes a fourth, by-reference argument: complete, false when the
    listing is only the answering node's share.  The Symfony adapter's
    clear() returns false, with a warning, when a listing was not complete,
    and sweeps in passes of 10000.  A failed async handshake is an
    authentication error naming the secret tried.  Needs libperfd 0.7.6.

 -- Yury Kirsanov <yury@kfi.net.au>  Wed, 18 Nov 2026 18:00:00 +1100

php-perfcached (0.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The seeds' second pass shares one connect_timeout_ms; a secret holding
    a NUL is a ValueError; the secrets file is warned about when its group
    or others have any access; the Symfony adapter's clear() escapes glob
    characters in its namespace.  Needs libperfd 0.7.6 for a 0.7.5 fleet.

 -- Yury Kirsanov <yury@kfi.net.au>  Fri, 13 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +1100

php-perfcached (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First package (PE-6): the PHP extension over libperfd, for PHP 8.3 NTS.

